OL,3,GNEWSABefrienders to curb elderly social
OL,4,Aisolation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA befriending project to help elderly
OL,7,Fpeople overcome loneliness has been
OL,8,Flaunched.
OL,10,FThe Enabling Connections programme, run
OL,11,Fby Age UK Northumberland, provides
OL,12,Fshort-term, face-to-face support for
OL,13,Fthose who have become socially isolated
OL,14,Fdue to life changes such as
OL,15,Fbereavement, time in hospital, or loved
OL,16,Fones moving away.
OL,18,FThey will be matched with a trained
OL,19,Fvolunteer, meeting on a weekly basis
OL,20,Ffor up to six months, who will work
OL,21,Fwith them to identify goals and break
OL,22,Fthese down into manageable steps.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
